    meaningUprightZh: "太阳散发出纯粹的快乐、成功与生命力。在月亮的不确定之后，太阳带来了绝对的清晰。这是整副牌中最积极的牌——保证有利的结果、充满活力的健康与真正的幸福。庆祝吧。这份温暖是你应得的。无需道歉地闪耀。",
    meaningReversedEn: "Reversed, the Sun is partially obscured. Success is delayed, joy feels muted, or self-doubt clouds your inner light. The sun is still there behind the clouds. This is temporary dimming, not permanent darkness.",
