      love: { en: "Love basks in full sunlight — warm, open, and genuine. A happy partnership or a joyful new romance lights up your world. For singles: your radiance is magnetic. The right person sees you clearly now.", zh: "爱情沐浴在完整的阳光中——温暖、开放且真诚。一段幸福的伴侣关系或一段愉快的新恋情照亮了你的世界。单身者：你的光彩是有磁性的。对的人此刻清晰地看到了你。" },
