      idol: { en: "This idol brings pure, uncomplicated joy into your life. Their light amplifies your own. Celebrate this connection without shame or overthinking — just bask in the shared sunshine.", zh: "这位爱豆将纯粹、简单的快乐带入你的生活。他们的光放大了你自己的。无需羞耻或过度思考地庆祝这份连接——只管沐浴在共享的阳光中。" },
