      career: { en: "A true calling is making itself known. You may feel pulled toward more meaningful work. A career audit reveals what's aligned and what needs to be released. Answer the higher calling.", zh: "一个真正的召唤正在显现。你可能感到被拉向更有意义的工作。一场职业审计揭示了什么是对齐的、什么需要释放。回应更高的召唤。" },
      idol: { en: "This idol connection is awakening something ancient within you. Their art touches a soul memory. The resonance you feel is a call to remember who you truly are.", zh: "这份爱豆连接正在唤醒你内在某种古老的东西。他们的艺术触动了灵魂的记忆。你感受到的共振是一个召唤，要你记起你真正是谁。" },
